cards.text:
For each primary trigger family you identified, trace it back:

{red|When did you first learn to react this way? What experiences taught your nervous system that this was a threat?}

Be specific about the people, situations, and time periods involved.

{red|How have you handled restore after emotional reactions in the past?}

{red|Have you taken responsibility? Apologized genuinely? Or have you blamed, minimized, or avoided?}

{red|What needs to change in how you approach restore?}
